<title>USA: Entergy 840 MW Ark. coal unit to shut Sun..</title>
<headline>Entergy 840 MW Ark. coal unit to shut Sun..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Entergy Corp's 840 megawatt Independence 2 coal-fired power unit in Newark, Ark., will shut down Sunday for one week, the company said Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;There's a tube leak that needs to be repaired. It's been running all summer long,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>--H McCulloch, New York Power Desk +212-859-1628</p>
</text>
